{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1077.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"16d7cc5dd316652f7695f949693876835d76aed3c9a8bbdb1c939e97ae8c6aeb","ja":"レッスンが始まる時間！","zh":"开始训练的时间！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1077.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"10347318dac42cfe9c953ddcf184c08dfb6c737d95d6ef9ec283eb19933dfbf4","ja":"某日。スケジュールの合間を利用して、\n亜美と昴は、喫茶店で話し込んでいた……","zh":"某天。亚美和昴利用工作安排的空档，\n正在咖啡店里热切地聊着天……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1077.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"e2147920e15826f71121aa76a2f73c6bd69b0eab7efaca3d79ef4c356b0120ea","ja":"そんでね、真美にヤンデレ演技を仕掛けたら、\nあっちもノリノリになっちゃったんだ！","zh":"然后啊，我冲着真美演起了病娇，\n结果她那边也演得可起劲了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1077.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f1cce514fcc693be1b9cc6c572fb383c17c4fe9fa8c8989089c32e2d06957007","ja":"ははっ、双子でそろってヤンデレし合うって、\nなんかワケわかんなくなりそうだな～！","zh":"哈哈，双胞胎两个人一起互相病娇，\n感觉会变得莫名其妙啊～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1077.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"118594abfa80de5b3122edf8f3b90fc680e06edf10b271d39f7e155ae82446e2","ja":"……って、わぁ！　もうこんな時間！？\nレッスン始まっちゃうよ！？","zh":"……不对，哇啊！都这个时间了！？\n练习都要开始了！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1077.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"730431e7abb337aea1d5a84f6969345542d7063d62cf5f5463bf7e8607dfeacf","ja":"むむっ！　どうやら、亜美の神トークが\n炸裂しすぎてしまったようですな～！","zh":"唔唔！看来是亚美超神的口才\n发挥得太过头了是也～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1077.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"e5b8bceb4c2a5e9e920d59f1a3e8482d20fbdf35054ef60afcfc278f869bd22e","ja":"でも、問題ナッシング！　ちゃんと連絡したら\nしほりんとなでしこも許してくれるって！","zh":"不过，完全没问题！只要好好联络，\n志保和小抚子也肯定会原谅的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1077.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"8cc53f88b41164557e6245f71aafbfcdc5f352597c4eb7a43c2b727d6825a704","ja":"そ、そうだな！　じゃあ、メッセージを……。\n「ごめん、オレと亜美、ちょっと遅れる」っと……。","zh":"也是，说得对！那发条消息……\n“抱歉，我和亚美要稍微迟到一会儿”，好了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1077.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"731105f7fdd6d91071511f00ba9165c57441c4bef67c784fa1b6c702674ae78d","ja":"ピロリンッ！","zh":"叮咚！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1077.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"af5eb4c1143e96c34742b394b2a1c6b5f50ff5361fe99661e1e8743e4c9c37c6","ja":"おっ！　志保からもう返事きた。","zh":"哦！志保已经回信了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1077.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"12238631a05d0b6b78628507b93566999321194dfe5f3d7725d5475e391d7995","ja":"「何時くらい？」","zh":"“大概几点？”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1077.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"3c13e2f43b71e4d1e956f5b628de048269d376d2e81b70ecd8912b4dd03d62c0","ja":"そうだね～。スイーツ食べたばっかだから\nのんびり行きたいし。あと1時間くらいは……。","zh":"是啊～。刚吃完甜点，\n想悠闲一点呢。至少还要再过1小时左右吧……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1077.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"9fb5af60ee4a2a4615b2528d5b6830ea7628fe29572a64795e3045954922dcea","ja":"「何時くらい？」「何時くらい？」「何時くらい？」\n「何時くらい？」「何時くらい？」「何時くらい？」","zh":"「大概几点？」「大概几点？」「大概几点？」\n「大概几点？」「大概几点？」「大概几点？」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1077.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"421b28ec1030b59df92ee7b7dcce2e4c74fcb3358d1c1f61d4a8e1278238c861","ja":"わぁっ！？　なんだ、なんだ！？\nメッセージが連続して……！？","zh":"哇啊！？怎么了，怎么回事！？\n消息连续发过来了……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1077.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"8d4d92d80e0730030acc5c1df0cd49d829bdf0bd07bd81334061dcd39caeaa78","ja":"「どうして遅刻しそうなの？」「どうして遅刻しそうな\nの？」「どうして遅刻しそうなの？」「どうして……」","zh":"“为什么好像要迟到了呢？”“为什么好像要迟到了\n呢？”“为什么好像要迟到了呢？”“为什么……”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1077.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"17aafa125f39e6b85bfed9ed82ff87673b71d08fecb753b349867cd271362bcb","ja":"し、しほりん！？\nもしかして……め、めっちゃ怒ってる～～～！？","zh":"志、志保亲！？\n难不成……非、非常生气吗～～～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
